HOW IT BECOMES ACTUALLY REMEMBERED
  A memory file nobody reads is decoration. Added rule 10 to the global layer, which IS injected into
  every conversation: it carries the trigger condition, the path, and the four highest-frequency points.
  Everything else is read on demand. This keeps the per-turn cost tiny while making the knowledge
  reachable, which is the same index-style pattern used for the LCEDA rules.

SELF-REFERENTIAL NOTE
  The very act of writing this file hit the trap listed as item 1: two consecutive inline PowerShell
  attempts failed because non-ASCII text in `pwsh -Command` gets mangled, and the fix was to write a
  Python file (Python 3 defaults to UTF-8, no BOM needed) onto the NTFS drive and execute that. The trap
  entry is therefore not theoretical - it cost two failed attempts while documenting itself.

